LICENSE PENDING — DO NOT DISTRIBUTE

The license for ADAF-RedTeam is an open decision (DESIGN.md §10). Until it is
resolved, treat this repository as "all rights reserved": do not redistribute,
publish, or use outside the authorizing party.

This tool performs offensive Active Directory validation. It may be run only
under a written, scoped engagement (see THREAT-MODEL.md and the runtime
authorization gate). Absence of a chosen open-source license here is deliberate,
not an oversight — pick MIT vs. a source-available / use-restricted license
before making the repository public.
